message: "Please cite the IMAS software and the associated manuscript when using this repository."
title: "IMAS: Integrative Multi-omic Augmentation System"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-08-02
authors:
  - name: "IMAS Development Team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ORG/IMAS"
abstract: >-
  IMAS is a computational framework for tumour single-cell multiomic integration,
  multi-layer target dependencies, cell-cell communication, communication
  pseudotime, and virtual perturbation analysis.
keywords:
  - single-cell multiomics
  - RNA-ATAC
  - tumour microenvironment
  - virtual perturbation
